From 1606e5ec8d2a9a8dcc03fc7a8791c297c55bfbba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yogesh Sevda <yogesh@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 16:04:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add bow splitting-arrow upgrade

Upgraded bow fires three arrows (center + +/-15 degree spread) instead
of one. Reuses task/124's WeaponUpgradeComponent/UpgradeCommand
framework: bow is added to the default upgrade map and to the
'upgrade' terminal command (upgrade bow / upgrade bow off).

Each arrow is spawned and path-blocked independently, so a wall
blocking the centre arrow does not stop the two side arrows. Damage
per arrow is full (unscaled) resolveHitboxDamage() -- the upgrade's
benefit is arrow count, not a damage multiplier.

Ref #125
